\n\nDefeat Gremlins:\nOvercome risks and issues by battling gremlins, enhancing your problem-solving skills.\n\nBridge Building: \nConstruct one of multiples bridges types,  applying project management principles to ensure success.\n\nResource Management & Team Coordination:\nManage resources wisely and work with a team to bring your bridge project to completion.\n\nLearn Valuable Life Skills:\nGain insights into leadership, teamwork, strategic planning, and adaptability through real-life project scenarios.\n \nExperience:\nWhether a beginner or a seasoned pro, \"The Task Titans\" offers a fun and educational way to sharpen your project management skills.", "short_description": "Jump into the role of a project manager in \"The Task Titans,\" where you'll tackle various challenges from saving spaceships to constructing bridges and solving treasure maps."}]}, "developer_name": "START", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://taleoconnects.com/privacypolicy-tasktitans", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taleo", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://taleoconnects.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7486606131429064"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1925809157982153"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "901164614877254"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "406446488